:false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":70.19999694824219,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"achi_46","strName":"热心肠的写信人","strDescription":"回复爱慕者信件5封。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1669980/d3a7addffb2da0dd77eaa2e1424383442c5b6837.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":70.0999984741211,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"achi_58","strName":"女儿的陪伴","strDescription":"与女儿的好感达到100。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1669980/e5585979dce2e967ef3168698f12943aadc4d1bb.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":69.9000015258789,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"achi_102","strName":"秋天快乐！","strDescription":"进入第一个秋天","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1669980/48951445da56a56c3f7cb984a9f39aa24e516032.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":69,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"achi_36","strName":"聊天积极分子","strDescription":"和人聊天50次。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1669980/17eff91aac628dd6d02dd4f6475df58e1fa9cb6a.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":68.80000305175781,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":234,"nAchieved":0}}],["achievementmap",{"version":5,"data":"[]"}],["usernews",{"version":5,"data":["COoHEOal+sgGGV55bwIAAHABISBIThUBABABKVx7GQAAAAAAUVoCQPRrdJIIYKqo+sgGcOal+sgG"]}],["gameactivity",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"养蛋人 Egg Hatcher","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/44718870"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"养蛋人 Egg Hatcher","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/44718870"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Egg Hatcher","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/44718870"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[p][b]欢迎来到「火山的女儿」！[/b]\r\n[/p][p]《火山的女儿》是一款多结局美少女模拟养成游戏，在游戏中，玩家将在剑与魔法、炼金术盛行的火山国抚育女儿不断成长，而你和女儿所做出的决定甚至可能会影响到整个火山国的未来。\r\n[/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][img width=\"600\" height=\"93\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/cb5af89704387902771e2fe705aaf68a.avif?t=1746063344[/img][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/82a3dcc28d600254438d609049b001ec.poster.avif?t=1746063344\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/82a3dcc28d600254438d609049b001ec.webm?t=1746063344\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"][/imgvid]经典中世纪架空背景，在剑与魔法的世界里，将女儿培养成才。你所面对的不仅是女儿成长过程中遇到的各种问题，更要时刻准备应对魔族的挑战。魔族首领“鸮姬”卷土重来之际，不为人知的暗流也在涌动，各种谜团等你揭晓。\r\n[/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][img width=\"600\" height=\"93\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/c4c3a8e9f24377e7861b16cee216ff0d.avif?t=1746063344[/img][img width=\"600\" height=\"338\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/ec96533ca2d055ed76cba5b4ba214a27.avif?t=1746063344[/img]人生道路上的每一次抉择都会改变成长的方向，女儿的每一次决定也势必会导向不一样的结局。游戏将提供给玩家超过50个可选结局，情感结局与职业结局完全分离，其中感情结局数量有12个以上，可攻略男女角色均为5人以上。\r\n[/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][img width=\"600\" height=\"93\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/d2a64d5f3c8a67108b9b009b42995c32.avif?t=1746063344[/img][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/c9f3155a489b4da649279598bb764761.poster.avif?t=1746063344\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/c9f3155a489b4da649279598bb764761.webm?t=1746063344\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"][/imgvid]游戏中准备了多条养成路线，以及数十种养成方式和小游戏，种植、烹饪、钓鱼、骰子游戏、决斗、剧院、舞会、赛马、暗巷等等，玩家可以根据自己的喜好来对女儿进行培养。\r\n[/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][img width=\"600\" height=\"93\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/f7ccde77183303f3a9fcea46f1a2f008.avif?t=1746063344[/img]成为王国骑士，探索危险的迷宫，采用经典回合制战斗，与你的伙伴一起击败阻挡在面前的所有敌人。面对魔族的进逼，唯有击败枭姬才可以拯救整个火山国。\r\n[/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][img width=\"600\" height=\"93\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/8768dddb159660add2972b80a2e37db9.avif?t=1746063344[/img][img width=\"600\" height=\"560\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/051a73fcad40f16014efce0479838bc3.avif?t=1746063344[/img]火山国居住着各色各样的居民，他们会陪伴着女儿一同成长，在成长的过程中，女儿会与这些居民进行交流，从而产生不一样的感情与羁绊。随着时间流逝，点滴的情感终将汇聚到一起，形成令人难以忘怀的回忆。\r\n[/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][img width=\"600\" height=\"93\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669980/extras/a5209646add4e90a44b7c336818f0b5d.avif?t=1746063344[/img]特邀日本知名声优中原麻衣（《寒蝉鸣泣之时》龙宫礼奈、《CLANNAD》古河渚）为日文版女儿配音，相信会给你带来不一样的体验。\r\n[/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][b]关于养蛋人工作室[/b]\r\n[/p][p]大家好！感谢大家一直以来对《火山的女儿》的支持与厚爱，养蛋人工作室是由2名热心游戏人组成的小型工作室，作为工作室开发的第一款游戏，《火山的女儿》如同“女儿”一般，我们对她倾注了极大的热情和精力。历经三年时间，我们见证了她从呱呱坠地，到牙牙学语，从蹒跚学步，再到如今终于要和所有玩家见面了，希望大家都会喜欢她。[/p]","strSnippet":"《火山的女儿》是一款多结局养成游戏。妻子逝去后，你就成了她唯一的守护者。你需要悉心安排她的生活，陪伴她成长。在家庭之外，人魔之间的矛盾愈演愈烈，在魔族首领“鸮姬”卷土重来之际，火山国需要更多的光明的力量。女儿将成为一名怎样的女性？火山国的未来又将走向何方？你的每个选择都很重要。"}}]]